{"articleNo":"835","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=835&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2009년도 교육역량강화사업(전담직원) 채용시험 공고","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.05.29","hit":"16494","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div align=\"justify\">\n<table border=\"0\" width=\"516\" align=\"center\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td height=\"119\" width=\"510\">\n            <p align=\"justify\"><strong><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">금오공과대학교 공고 제2009-4호</span></font></strong></p>\n            <p align=\"justify\"><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"></span></font>&nbsp;</p>\n            <p align=\"center\"><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong>2009년도 교육역량강화사업(전담직원) 채용시험 공고</strong></span></font></p>\n            <p align=\"justify\"><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"></span></font>&nbsp;</p>\n            <p align=\"justify\"><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;2009년도 교육역량강화사업(전담직원) 채용시험 시행계획을 다음과 같이 공고합니다.</span></font></p>\n            <p align=\"justify\"><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"></span></font>&nbsp;</p>\n            <p align=\"right\"><strong><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2009년 5월 &nbsp;29일 &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font></strong></p>\n            <p align=\"right\"><strong><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;금오공과대학교총장 &nbsp;</span></font></strong></p>\n            <p align=\"center\"><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"></span></font>&nbsp;</p>\n            <p align=\"left\"><strong><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"></span></font></strong>&nbsp;</p>\n            <p align=\"justify\"><strong><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;1. 채용예정직급 및 인원</span></font></strong><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;</span></font> </p>\n            <table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"1\" cellpadding=\"3\" width=\"500\" bgcolor=\"#999999\" align=\"center\">\n                <tbody>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td bgcolor=\"#f7f7f7\" height=\"30\" width=\"192\">\n                        <p align=\"center\"><strong><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">구 분</span></font></strong></p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td bgcolor=\"#f7f7f7\" height=\"30\" width=\"115\">\n                        <p align=\"center\"><strong><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">채용인원</span></font></strong></p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td bgcolor=\"#f7f7f7\" height=\"30\" width=\"230\">\n                        <p align=\"center\"><strong><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;담당 업무</span></font></strong></p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td bgcolor=\"#f7f7f7\" height=\"30\" width=\"163\">\n                        <p align=\"center\"><strong><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">근무부서 </span></font></strong></p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td bgcolor=\"#f7f7f7\" height=\"30\" width=\"97\">\n                        <p align=\"center\"><strong><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">비 고</span></font></strong></p>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" height=\"62\" rowspan=\"2\" width=\"192\">\n                        <p align=\"center\"><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">교육역량강화사업</span></font></p>\n                        <p align=\"center\"><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">(자체 계약직원)</span></font></p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" height=\"31\" width=\"115\">\n                        <p align=\"center\"><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">1명</span></font></p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" height=\"62\" rowspan=\"2\" width=\"230\">\n                        <p align=\"center\"><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">교육역량강화사업 </span></font></p>\n                        <p align=\"center\"><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">업무지원</span></font></p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" height=\"31\" width=\"163\">\n                        <p align=\"center\"><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">기획협력과</span></font></p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" height=\"31\" width=\"97\">\n                        <p align=\"center\"><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"></span></font>&nbsp;</p>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" height=\"30\" width=\"115\">\n                        <p align=\"center\"><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">1명</span></font></p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" height=\"30\" width=\"163\">\n                        <p align=\"center\"><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">학생과</span></font></p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" height=\"30\" width=\"97\">\n                        <p align=\"center\"><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"></span></font>&nbsp;</p>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                </tbody>\n            </table>\n            <p></p>\n            <p align=\"center\"><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"></span></font>&nbsp;</p>\n            <p align=\"center\"><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"></span></font>&nbsp;</p>\n            <p><strong><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2. 응시자격 &nbsp;</span></font></strong></p>\n            <p align=\"left\"><strong><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;■</span></font></strong><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> 국가공무원법 제33조(결격사유) 각호의 결격사유에 해당되지 아니한 자</span></font></p>\n            <p align=\"justify\"><strong><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></font><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">■</span></font></strong><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> 시험공고일 전일(2009.05.29) 기준으로 주민등록상 주소지가 대구·경북으로 되어 </span></font></p>\n            <p align=\"justify\"><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 있는 자</span></font></p>\n            <p align=\"justify\"><strong><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font></strong></p>\n            <p><strong><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">3. 계약기간 및 보수</span></font></strong></p>\n            <p align=\"justify\"><strong><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></font><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">■</span></font></strong><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> 계약기간 : 2009.06월중 ∼ 2010. 2. 28</span></font></p>\n            <p align=\"justify\"><strong><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></font><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">■</span></font></strong><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> 보수수준 : 월 1,300,000원 정도(복리후생비 및 4대 보험금 포함)</span></font></p>\n            <p align=\"justify\"><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"></span></font>&nbsp;</p>\n            <p><strong><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">4. 시 험 방 법</span></font></strong></p>\n            <p align=\"justify\"><strong><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;가. 1차 시험(서류전형) </span></font></strong></p>\n            <p align=\"justify\"><strong><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font></strong><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;</span></font><strong><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">■ </span></font></strong><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">응시자의 학력·자격 등이 소정의 기준에 적합한지 여부를 심사</span></font></p>\n            <p align=\"justify\"><strong><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font></strong><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;</span></font><strong><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">■ </span></font></strong><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">응시원서 접수시 응시자가 제출한 서류를 활용하여 심사</span></font></p>\n            <p align=\"left\"><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"></span></font>&nbsp;</p>\n            <p align=\"left\"><strong><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;나. 2차 시험(면접시험) </span></font></strong></p>\n            <p align=\"left\"><strong><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;■</span></font></strong><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> 1차 서류전형 합격자에 한하여 실시하되, 평정 성적이 우수한 자 순으로&nbsp;최종합격</span></font></p>\n            <p align=\"left\"><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 자를 결정함.</span></font></p>\n            <p align=\"justify\"><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"></span></font>&nbsp;</p>\n            <p><strong><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">5. 시험 일정 및 합격자 발표</span></font></strong></p>\n            <p align=\"justify\"><strong><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"></span></font></strong></p>\n            <table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"1\" cellpadding=\"3\" width=\"500\" bgcolor=\"#999999\" align=\"center\">\n                <tbody>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td bgcolor=\"#f7f7f7\" height=\"30\" width=\"192\">\n                        <p align=\"center\"><strong><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">구 &nbsp;&nbsp;분</span></font></strong></p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td bgcolor=\"#f7f7f7\" height=\"30\" width=\"263\">\n                        <p align=\"center\"><strong><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">일 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;시</span></font></strong></p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td bgcolor=\"#f7f7f7\" height=\"30\" width=\"319\">\n                        <p align=\"center\"><strong><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">장 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;소</span></font></strong></p>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" height=\"30\" width=\"192\">\n                        <p align=\"justify\"><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">채용공고</span></font></p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" height=\"30\" width=\"263\">\n                        <p align=\"justify\"><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;2009. 5. 29(금)∼ 6. 10(수)</span></font></p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" height=\"30\" width=\"319\">\n                        <p align=\"justify\"><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;- 금오공과대학교 홈페이지 </span></font></p>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" height=\"40\" width=\"192\">\n                        <p align=\"justify\"><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">응시원서 접수기간</span></font></p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" height=\"40\" width=\"263\">\n                        <p align=\"justify\"><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;<font color=\"#0000ff\">2009. 6. 8(월)∼ 6. 10(수)</font></span></font></p>\n                        <p align=\"justify\"><font color=\"#0000ff\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(09:00~17:00까지)</span></font></p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" height=\"40\" width=\"319\">\n                        <p align=\"justify\"><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;- 금오공과대학교 총무과</span></font></p>\n                        <p align=\"justify\"><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(글로벌관 5층 530호) </span></font></p>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" height=\"71\" width=\"192\">\n                        <p align=\"justify\"><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">서류전형 실시</span></font></p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" height=\"71\" width=\"263\">\n                        <p align=\"justify\"><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;2009. 6. 12(금) 10:00∼ </span></font></p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" height=\"71\" width=\"319\">\n                        <p align=\"justify\"><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;- 서류전형 실시</span></font></p>\n                        <p align=\"justify\"><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;- 합격자 통지 </span></font></p>\n                        <p align=\"justify\"><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;- 면접시험 일시 및 장소 안내</span></font></p>\n                        <p align=\"justify\"><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(개별적으로 통보) </span></font></p>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" height=\"54\" width=\"192\">\n                        <p align=\"justify\"><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">면접시험 실시</span></font></p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" height=\"54\" width=\"263\">\n                        <p align=\"justify\"><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;2009. 6. 17(수) 14:00∼</span></font></p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" height=\"54\" width=\"319\">\n                        <p align=\"justify\"><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;- 금오공과대학교 총무과장실</span></font></p>\n                        <p align=\"justify\"><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(글로벌관 5층) &nbsp;</span></font></p>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" height=\"30\" width=\"192\">\n                        <p align=\"justify\"><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">최종합격자 발표</span></font></p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" height=\"30\" width=\"263\">\n                        <p align=\"justify\"><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;2009. 6. 19(금) 14:00 &nbsp;</span></font></p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" height=\"30\" width=\"319\">\n                        <p align=\"justify\"><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;- 개별적으로 통보 </span></font></p>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                </tbody>\n            </table>\n            <p></p>\n            <p align=\"justify\"><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"></span></font>&nbsp;</p>\n            <p><strong><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">6. 응시원서 교부 및 접수</span></font></strong></p>\n            <p align=\"left\"><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font><strong><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">■</span></font></strong><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> 접수기간 : 2009.6.8(월)∼6.10(수) 09:00~17:00까지</span></font></p>\n            <p align=\"justify\"><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 원서는 금오공과대학교 홈페이지(<font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">http://www.kumoh.ac.kr</span></font></span></font><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">)에서 </span></font></p>\n            <p align=\"justify\"><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다운받아 사용</span></font></p>\n            <p align=\"justify\"><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font><strong><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">■ </span></font></strong><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">접수장소 : 금오공과대학교 총무과(글로벌관 5층&nbsp;530호)</span></font></p>\n            <p align=\"justify\"><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font><strong><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">■</span></font></strong><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> 접수방법 : 응시자가 직접 방문하여 접수(우편접수는 불가)</span></font></p>\n            <p align=\"left\"><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"></span></font>&nbsp;</p>\n            <p><strong><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">7. 제출서류</span></font></strong></p>\n            <p align=\"left\"><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font><strong><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">■</span></font></strong><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> 응시원서(소정양식, 6개월이내 촬영 반명함판 사진 2매 부착) 1부</span></font></p>\n            <p align=\"left\"><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 정부수입인지(5,000원) 응시원서에 부착</span></font></p>\n            <p align=\"left\"><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font><strong><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">■</span></font></strong><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> 이력서(반명함판 사진부착) 및 자기소개서(A4용지,1~2매) 각 1부</span></font></p>\n            <p align=\"left\"><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font><strong><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">■</span></font></strong><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> 주민등록초본 1부</span></font></p>\n            <p align=\"left\"><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><strong>■</strong></span></font><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> 자격증 원본 및 사본 1부(해당자에 한함).</span></font></p>\n            <p align=\"left\"><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font><strong><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">■</span></font></strong><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> 최종학력증명서 1부</span></font></p>\n            <p align=\"left\"><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><strong>■</strong></span></font><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> 신분증(주민등록증, 운전면허증 등) 지참</span></font></p>\n            <p align=\"justify\"><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"></span></font>&nbsp;</p>\n            <p><strong><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">8. 기타사항 </span></font></strong></p>\n            <p align=\"left\"><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></font><strong><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">■</span></font></strong><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> 제출한 서류는 일절 수정하거나 반환하지 아니하며, 기재사항 착오 및 누락&nbsp;등으로 </span></font></p>\n            <p align=\"left\"><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 인한 불이익은 응시자의 책임으로 함. &nbsp;</span></font></p>\n            <p align=\"justify\"><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font><strong><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">■</span></font></strong><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> 응시표를 분실한 자는 시험 실시 30분 이전까지 시험실시본부에서 응시표를 재교부 </span></font></p>\n            <p align=\"justify\"><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 받아 응시할 수 있음(재교부시 동일 원판의 사진 1매 지참)</span></font></p>\n            <p align=\"justify\"><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font><strong><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">■</span></font></strong><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> 합격자 통지 후 신원조회 및 채용신체검사서에 결격사유가 있을 경우와 응시원서 등</span></font></p>\n            <p align=\"justify\"><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 에 기재된 내용이 허위로 판명될 경우 합격 또는 임용을 취소함.</span></font></p>\n            <p align=\"justify\"><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><strong>■</strong></span></font><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> 우대요건 : 워드프로세서 3급등 전산관련 자격증 소지자</span></font></p>\n            <p align=\"justify\"><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; <strong>■</strong> 기타 문의사항 : 총무과 천병광&nbsp; ☎054)478-7094</span></font></p>\n            <p align=\"justify\"><font color=\"#494949\" face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.6pt; COLOR: #ff0000\">&nbsp;<font face=\"굴림\"><strong><font color=\"#494949\">■ </font></strong><font size=\"4\">기 공고 및 공고예정인 채용분야(기성회계약직, 교육역량강화사업 전담직원, 행&nbsp;정인턴쉽)은 복수지원 불가능 합니다.</font></font></span></span></font></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
